Dear Product Development Team,

Thank you for your request. We specialise in pet-themed ceramic travel cups and are happy to quote for your 2027 programme. Our full quotation is below. Product photos are attached.

COMMON SPECIFICATIONS (all 3 items)
- Capacity: 17 oz
- Size: 3.55 x 5.24 x 7 in (9.0 x 13.3 x 17.8 cm)
- Net weight: 1.21 lb (549 g) per cup with lid
- Materials: cup body = ceramic (stoneware); lid = PP plastic with silicone seal
- Care: dishwasher safe, top rack only
- Packaging: individual gift box
- Artwork: designed by our in-house team (EveArt studio)
- Colour: full-wrap multicolour print
- Country of origin: China (Ningbo)

ITEMS
Item No.  | Design              | Unit price (USD, FOB Ningbo) | MOQ       | Production lead time | Sea transit to US West Coast
TK3K53CTC | Golden Doodle dog   | 3.75                         | 400 pcs   | 70 days              | approx. 40 days
TKFNX3CTC | German Shepherd dog | 3.60                         | 800 pcs   | 65 days              | approx. 30 days
TK37Q3CTC | Assorted dogs       | 3.50                         | 1,000 pcs | 55 days              | approx. 30 days

TERMS
- Incoterm: FOB Ningbo. Prices valid for 30 days.
- Payment: 30% deposit, 70% balance before shipment.
- Samples: 1 free sample per design, courier cost paid by buyer, ready in 7 days.
- Compliance: FDA food-contact and LFGB test reports available on request. Prop 65 compliant.

Best regards,
Lily Chen | Sales Manager
PawPrint Ceramics Co., Ltd. | Ningbo, China | Tel +86 574 5550 0142

